==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Flashfire|Pineco|4}} from the {{TCG|Flashfire}} expansion; both cards have the Ram attack.
*'''Ram''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Zubat|70}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl}}.

